{"id":47362,"ord":74,"n_segments":152,"prev":47361,"next":47363,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Guitar technique and later career","title":"Honolulu with Jack McVey at Don the Beachcomber's","category":"touring_travel","summary":"He went to Honolulu with Jack McVey's show band, with Louise Beavers singing and a rhythm and blues repertoire.","period":"1950s","year_from":1950,"year_to":1959,"words":256,"start":[130,0],"end":[132,3],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125#s47362","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Honolulu","focus":1,"type":"city"},{"name":"Hawaii","focus":0,"type":"state"}],"venues":[{"name":"Don the Beachcomber's","focus":1,"city":"Honolulu"}],"bands":[{"name":"Jack McVey's band","focus":1,"leader":"Jack McVey"}]},"people":[{"name":"Jack McVey","qid":null,"n":5},{"name":"Louise Beavers","qid":null,"n":4},{"name":"Edgar Hayes","qid":"Q1283920","n":2},{"name":"Teddy Bunn","qid":"Q2399891","n":1},{"name":"Don the Beachcomber","qid":"Q5293781","n":1}],"story":{"theme":32,"theme_name":"Going west: California and the Los Angeles scene","community":57,"community_name":"Going west: moving to and working in California","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":130,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And then you also made a trip -- when you made the trip to Hawaii?"},{"p":130,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Honolulu."},{"p":130,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"To Honolulu, right."},{"p":130,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Right. Jack McVey."},{"p":130,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"With Jack McVey."},{"p":130,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yes."},{"p":130,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And who --"},{"p":130,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He took a group over there."},{"p":130,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see."},{"p":130,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And I can't remember none of the guys that was in it."},{"p":130,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Was that when you went to Don the Beachcomber's, or --"},{"p":130,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, Don the Beachcomber's."},{"p":130,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. Was that Edgar Hayes, or did you pick up some local musicians over there?"},{"p":130,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"No. Was I with Edgar then? No, I wasn't with Edgar then."},{"p":130,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"No, that was before."},{"p":130,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":130,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Before that."},{"p":130,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I was with Jack McVey."},{"p":130,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":130,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And -- oh, boy. What was that girl's"},{"p":131,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"name, Thelma?"},{"p":131,"b":1,"s":"","x":"Who, Teddy?"},{"p":131,"b":2,"s":"MS. BUNN (?)","x":"(Inaudible)"},{"p":131,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"When we went out with Jack McVey? Who sang?"},{"p":131,"b":4,"s":"MS. BUNN (?)","x":"I've forgotten. Louise."},{"p":131,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Louise. Louise Beavers."},{"p":131,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Louise Beavers?"},{"p":131,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":131,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see. What kind of a repertoire was that?"},{"p":131,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Well, the same kind I'm doing now."},{"p":131,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Rhythm and blues."},{"p":131,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, rhythm and blues."},{"p":131,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And some be-bop blues."},{"p":131,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And be-bop blues, and some classic -- I mean some things --"},{"p":131,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Ballads."},{"p":131,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Ballads."},{"p":131,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":131,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Of course what's his name would be doing his thing. Jack McVey would be doing his thing, like getting out in the middle of the floor, you know, on top of the bandstand."},{"p":131,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah."},{"p":131,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Doing his thing. Marching and all that,"},{"p":132,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"blowing his horn, shaking his head. And we'd all be -- I'd be playing, you know, and the girl would be doing her thing, you know."},{"p":132,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Right. Like a show band, almost."},{"p":132,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":132,"b":3,"s":"","x":"(End of proceedings as recorded.)"}]}